","label":"1","selected":true,"targetId":"sku-nur60xs-1-go"}]},"descriptionHtml":"<div><div><div>The Nur 60X Plan adds contemporary and functional flair to our Nur basin series with the addition of an internal tap landing and shelf. As part of our <a href=\"https://www.studiobagno.com.au/collection-organic\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Collection Organic</a>, the basin seamlessly blends with the entire range, mirroring the soft contours and floating aesthetic of the contemporary design narrative. </div><div>The Nur 60x Plan boasts a modern, yet timeless design thanks to its trademark curve, a difficult shape to achieve with traditional ceramic production methods. The basin  compatibility with our Milady Toilets and Nur or Lust Bath series creates a seamless and cohesive design throughout your bathroom fixtures.</div><div>Nur 60X Plan is available in white and additional Premium Palette colours, as well as one or no taphole options.</div><div>Handmade in Italy.</div></div><div><b>Note: </b>32mm non-overflow plug &amp; waste not included.</div><div><b>Recommended Plug &amp; Waste:<a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw006-go\">SBW006/GO</a></b><br/></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
